      "versionNonce": 1531740179,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763030400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "new CopilotRuntime({\n  agents: {\n    // native AG-UI endpoint: no BFF,\n    // no translation step\n    default: new HttpAgent({\n      url: ADK_AGUI_URL, // agent:8000/chat\n    }),\n  },\n\n  // dynamic A2UI: inject the render_a2ui\n  // tool + the catalog schema in the run\n  a2ui: { injectA2UITool: true },\n})\n\n\nWhat the agent receives (RunAgentInput)\n\n  tools:    [ render_a2ui ]\n  context:  catalog schemas (Chart, …)\n            + A2UI guidelines",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "new CopilotRuntime({\n  agents: {\n    // native AG-UI endpoint: no BFF,\n    // no translation step\n    default: new HttpAgent({\n      url: ADK_AGUI_URL, // agent:8000/chat\n    }),\n  },\n\n  // dynamic A2UI: inject the render_a2ui\n  // tool + the catalog schema in the run\n  a2ui: { injectA2UITool: true },\n})\n\n\nWhat the agent receives (RunAgentInput)\n\n  tools:    [ render_a2ui ]\n  context:  catalog schemas (Chart, …)\n            + A2UI guidelines",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
