      "text": "ADKAgent(\n  adk_agent=root_agent,\n  a2ui={\"default_catalog_id\":\n        \"football_catalog\"},\n)\nadd_adk_fastapi_endpoint(\n  app, adk_agent, path=\"/chat\")\n\nLlmAgent(\n  tools=[bigquery_mcp,\n         AGUIToolset()],\n  instruction=prompts/*.md,\n)\n\n# a2ui.md (extract)\n\"Call render_a2ui with\n catalogId \"football_catalog\".\n Every component has an id\n and a component:\n {\"id\": \"chart\",\n  \"component\": \"Chart\",\n  \"chartType\": \"bar\",\n  \"data\": [...]}\"",
